Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:26.06,Hook,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 NO ME DEJÓ\NATROPELLARLOS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Vámonos de aquí, carajo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Soy hombre muerto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Se cagaron todos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Y yo que iba para\Nadelante y no me dejaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Quería atropellarlos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡La puta, boludo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estaba apretando R2 para\Npasarlos por arriba y no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}me dejaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no me dejaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No te deja ir para\Nadelante.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Lo que yo quería hacer es\Npuro GTA:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}atropellarlos, porque los\Ntengo adelante con armas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:25.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡boludo!
